Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.05,0:01:02.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马里兰州 巴尔的摩）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.78,0:02:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第2季第7集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.21,0:00:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸让我们继续他的事业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad wants us to pick up where he left off…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.33,0:00:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,救助他人 猎杀恶魔 家族事业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}saving people, hunting things, the family business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.71,0:00:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还在用信用卡欺诈吗？- 你以为干这事容易？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Still running credit-card scams? - Think credit card fraud's easy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 马科维茨先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Mr.Burkowitz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 联邦执法官 - 环境研究专业的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Federal marshals. - Environmental majors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.26,0:00:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是西蒙斯神父 美国野生动植物管理处的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father Simmons.U.S.Wildlife Service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奈吉尔·塔夫内尔 - 杰瑞·卡普兰医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nigel Tuffnel. - Dr.Jerry Kaplan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.89,0:00:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们是记者 - 警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Reporters. - Art dealers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,社区兄弟 国家安全局？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Students.Homeland Security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.23,0:00:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们来说这是违法的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty illegal, even for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.85,0:00:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,特警队发现了一名当地女性被绑架 而且还被封口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}SWAT team discovered a local woman bound and gagged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.69,0:00:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,袭击者是一名24到30岁的男性白人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her attacker, a white male, approximately 24 to 30 years of age…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.53,0:00:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且当场被抓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was discovered hiding in the home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.45,0:00:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 变形人？- 每个文化中都有变形人的传说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shapeshifter? - Every culture has a shapeshifter lore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.28,0:00:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以将自己变成任何动物或人形{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legends of creatures who can transform themselves into animals or other men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.87,0:00:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察认为艾米丽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops are blaming this Dean Winchester guy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.75,0:00:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是被迪恩·温彻斯特杀害的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Emily's murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.96,0:00:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 我可能会想念这个 - 想念什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry I'm gonna miss it. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.63,0:00:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底有多少次机会 能看到我自己的葬礼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many chances will I have to see my own funeral?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.39,0:01:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,用这个名字？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under what name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.10,0:01:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 那是我最喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, that's my favorite so far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.65,0:01:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个州可能用的ID我们已经知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possible IDs in three states that we know of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.82,0:01:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再打给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta call you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.17,0:01:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我还以为你只是个新手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}first I thought you were just stepping up your game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.50,0:01:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,信用卡欺诈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Credit card fraud…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.46,0:01:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,非法进入 这个有点让人不解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}breaking and entering.Now, this one puzzled me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.38,0:01:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖坟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grave desecration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.51,0:01:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这些都比不上杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But still, these are a long way from murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.77,0:01:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣路易丝有传真给我们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we get a fax from St.Louis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.52,0:01:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那里被怀疑 虐待和杀害一名年轻女性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you're suspected of torturing and murdering a young woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.03,0:01:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 没人能证明这一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, no one could prove anything, of course…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.65,0:01:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你在那里假死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because, supposedly, you died there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.53,0:02:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 双手放在我可以看见的地方 - 但我想告诉你一些事…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands where I can see them. - But I gotta tell you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.54,0:02:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去还很健壮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look pretty healthy to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 凯伦·吉尔斯并不是你杀的第一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now we know Karen Giles wasn't the first person you murdered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.21,0:02:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,想逃吗 萨姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going somewhere, Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.88,0:02:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可以保证 她将会是最后一个受害者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I guarantee you, she's the last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.24,0:02:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你也许口渴了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you might be thirsty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.74,0:02:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so you're the good cop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.58,0:02:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个坏警察呢？- 和你老哥在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the bad cop? - He's with your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.13,0:02:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还留我们这在里做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.And you're holding us why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.09,0:02:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在是杀人嫌疑犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's being held on suspicion of murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.30,0:02:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你呢？我们要看着办了 - 杀人犯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you? We'll see. - Murder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.26,0:03:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,听声音感觉你真的很惊讶 要么你就是个不错的演员？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound genuinely surprised.Or are you that good of an actor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.14,0:03:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他到底杀了谁了？- 我们会查出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's he supposed to have murdered? - We'll get to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.76,0:03:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有正式被起诉之前你不能扣留我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just hold us here without charges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.98,0:03:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我们可以扣留你们48小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually, we can for 48 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.98,0:03:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是前法律系学生 你知道这条规定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you, being a prelaw student, would know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.81,0:03:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你很了解 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know all about you, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.78,0:03:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你23岁 没工作 没家庭住址{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're 23 years old, no job, no home address.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.11,0:03:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在婴儿时你妈就死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother died when you were a baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.57,0:03:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲下落不明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father's whereabouts are unknown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.45,0:03:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你老哥迪恩有案子在身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there's the case of your brother, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的死真有点夸张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose demise was, well, just a little bit exaggerated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好像过得很随心所欲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel free to jump in whenever you like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思了？没问题 我会继续的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shy? No problem, I'll keep going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.72,0:03:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你儿时你家搬过很多次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your family moved around a lot when you were a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,除此之外 你还是个A等生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite that, you were a straight A student.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.14,0:03:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿全年奖学金进入斯坦福德大学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got into Stanford with a full ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.64,0:03:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在一年前 你的公寓着了一场火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, about a year ago, there was a fire in your apartment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死了 杰西卡·穆尔 你的女朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One fatality, Jessica Moore, your girlfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.49,0:04:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她死后 你就不见踪影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After she died, you fell off the grid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.86,0:04:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃了一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left behind everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.82,0:04:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要时间来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed some time off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.74,0:04:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,养伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.12,0:04:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我和我老哥一起公路旅行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm taking a road trip with my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.12,0:04:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that going for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.75,0:04:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.83,0:04:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看到了美国大陆上的第二大绒线球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we saw the second largest ball of twine in the continental U.S.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.01,0:04:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.22,0:04:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在档案库里找到了迪恩的指纹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ran Dean's fingerprints through AFIS.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 而且可能有几十个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Got over a dozen possible hits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.23,0:04:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,「可能」的指纹 那就没有什么意义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possible hits.Which makes them worthless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.06,0:04:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你想想 如果我们也找到了你的指纹呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But makes you wonder.What are we gonna find when we run your prints?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.36,0:04:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 嗯… 你会让我知道的 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.Well, you be sure to let me know, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.36,0:04:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能喝吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.53,0:04:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请吧 - 太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please. - Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你是个好孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you seem like a good kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩当你的哥哥不是你的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your fault Dean's your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.71,0:04:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能选择我们的出身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't pick our family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.42,0:05:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在圣路易丝的侦探在挖坟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, detectives in St.Louis are exhuming a corpse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们试着找出 在虐待了那么多妇女之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're trying to figure out how your brother faked his own death…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.93,0:05:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥是如何玩假死把戏的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}after torturing all those young women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.60,0:05:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩不是个好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's a bad guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.22,0:05:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的生活已经结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His life is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.56,0:05:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的生活没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours doesn't have to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我指证我老哥？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to turn against my own brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.73,0:05:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我们在凯伦·吉尔斯的被害现场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.We already caught him cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.11,0:05:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住这个冷血 双手沾满血的家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red handed at the Karen Giles murder scene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.61,0:05:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是需要你… 说出我们不知道的片断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just need you to fill in some missing pieces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.62,0:05:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要那么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.79,0:05:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我可以向检查官求情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I can talk to the DA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.08,0:05:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你做个交易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a deal for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.34,0:05:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以继续你的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can get on with your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩就让他沉沦吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's as good as gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.81,0:05:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲和托尼·吉尔斯是老朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad and Tony Giles were old friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.77,0:05:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一直在一起工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were in the service together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.98,0:06:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我们在孩童时代就认识他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've known him since we were kids, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.77,0:06:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以在听到他的死讯就马上赶过去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came when we heard about his death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安东尼·吉尔斯 - 谁是安东尼·吉尔斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anthony Giles. - Who's Anthony Giles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.45,0:06:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尔的摩的一个律师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Baltimore lawyer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.12,0:06:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在办公室工作很晚 你可以看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working late at his office.Check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的喉咙被割断了 但他的房间却很干净{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His throat was slit, but the room was clean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有DNA 没有指纹 - 看下去 会好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No DNA, no prints. - Keep reading.It gets better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.76,0:06:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,保安录相带没有拍到攻击者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Security cameras failed to capture footage of the assailant."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或者有人拿走了录相带 - 要么他就是隐形杀手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Somebody tampered with the tapes. - Or it's an invisible killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我种喜欢这种案子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My favorite kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.85,0:06:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有什么想法 斯卡利？- 我不是斯卡利 你才是斯卡利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What you think, Scully? Check it out? - I'm not Scully.You're Scully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.69,0:06:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是马尔德 你是那个红发女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm Mulder.You're a redheaded woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.32,0:06:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没有足够证据证明迪恩杀了托尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}would've been hard for Dean to kill Tony…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.65,0:06:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为那个时候不在城里 - 那告诉我接着发生了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …considering we weren't in town. - Tell me what happened next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 嗯 所以我们去看了凯伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that's when we went to see Karen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.87,0:06:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可能认不出我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was barely holding it together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.33,0:07:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是想去那里安慰下她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just wanted to be there for her, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.71,0:07:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,保险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insurance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.67,0:07:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经忘记保险的事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I totally forgot about the insurance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰你我们感到很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're very sorry to bother you right now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.68,0:07:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但保险公司还是需要做点调查的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the company is required to conduct its own investigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.10,0:07:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你明白的吧？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You understand? - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.39,0:07:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能告诉我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.If you could just tell us anything…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.60,0:07:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关你丈夫死那晚的一些情况吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you remember about the night your husband died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和托尼准备一起吃晚餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony and I were supposed to have dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.52,0:07:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打电话说他电脑有问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He called and said that he was having computer troubles…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.44,0:07:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以要加班{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he had to work late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.95,0:07:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.32,0:07:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为他会有什么仇人会这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any idea who could have done this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.58,0:07:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 就像我对警察说的那样 我 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.No.It's like I told the police, I have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.71,0:07:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼有提到一些不寻常的事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Tony mention anything unusual…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.21,0:07:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他死前的那几天？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to you in the days before his death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.21,0:07:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不寻常？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unusual?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.05,0:07:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 就是很奇怪的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, like strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.34,0:07:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奇怪 - 凯伦 很古怪的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Strange? - You know, Karen, weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:07:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,古怪的声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird noises…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.47,0:08:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,影像 诸如此类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}visions, anything like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.43,0:08:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ahem. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他死前他做了个噩梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a nightmare the day before he died, but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.07,0:08:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的噩梦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of a nightmare?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.91,0:08:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在半夜的时候他醒过来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that he woke up in the middle of the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个女人坐在他的床边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a woman standing at the foot of the bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他眼前一片空白 接着她就走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He blinked, she was gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是 那只是个恶梦而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it was just a nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有没有说她长的什么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he say what she looked like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.13,0:08:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的长相有那么重要吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell difference does it make what she looked like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.47,0:08:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的公司要调查的很彻底{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just our company's very thorough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.51,0:08:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说她很苍白 她有黑色和红色的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said she was pale and she had dark red eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.43,0:08:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我抱了下凯伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I gave Karen a hug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.27,0:08:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她如果需要帮助就打电话给我 就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told her to call me if she needed anything, and that was it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.44,0:08:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}End of story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.40,0:08:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我想帮你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I am trying to help you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.03,0:08:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要对我坦白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have got to be honest with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:09:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有目击证人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we have an eyewitness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.83,0:09:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见二个男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone who saw two men…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.20,0:09:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,身形和你俩一样的人闯入吉尔斯办公室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}fitting your and your brother's description breaking into Giles'office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.46,0:09:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 凯伦随后打电话给我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Karen called us later, said there was stuff she wanted…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.80,0:09:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想从托尼的办公室拿点东西 但警察不让她进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Tony's office, but the police weren't letting her in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.92,0:09:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就拿一张他们在巴黎的照片 还有些其它东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a picture of the two of them in Paris, and some other stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.30,0:09:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 进入犯罪现场是不对的行为 但是她给我们的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it was wrong to enter a crime scene, but she gave us the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.53,0:09:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉尔斯尸体就是在那儿被发现的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anthony Giles'body was found right about here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.82,0:09:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,喉咙口的切痕很深 都可以看到脊梁骨了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Throat slit so deep, part of his spinal cord was visible."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇恶灵？邪恶的复仇？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vengeful spirit, underline vengeful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.83,0:09:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.38,0:09:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看见了个女人坐在他的床头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he did see that woman at the foot of his bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.38,0:09:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.89,0:10:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs18\1c&H3CF1F3&}\NDana Shulps？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.89,0:10:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么 是名字？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that? A name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 但到处都是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but it's everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只工作 不玩耍 聪明小孩也变傻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All work and no play makes Jack a dull boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.75,0:10:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这事已经可以归入怪事之列了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.\NI'd say we've officially crossed over into weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.13,0:10:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉尔斯可能认识那恶灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Giles knew her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.59,0:10:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能是那白脸红眼神秘女孩的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's the name of our pale, red eyed mystery girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's see what we can see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.56,0:10:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,找不出Dana和Shulps这两个词的意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not a single mention of a Dana Shulps anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.44,0:10:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有Shulpsor{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not a D.Shulps…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:10:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或Shulps这样的词 - 好极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …or any other kind of frigging Shulps. - Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.44,0:10:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你找到什么？- 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you got? - Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少在过去50年内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Dana Shulps has ever lived or died in Baltimore…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.16,0:11:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巴尔的摩没有叫Dana Shulps的人 - 那现在怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …in the last 50 years, at least. - So, what now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.74,0:11:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我快要破解吉尔斯电脑里的密码了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think I'm pretty close to cracking Giles'password.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.79,0:11:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有可能这里面会有些发现 - 「快」是多久…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe something in his personal files. - By close you mean…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.25,0:11:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概30分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty minutes maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.05,0:11:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.80,0:11:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我还是出去晃晃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess I just get to hang out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.47,0:11:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So awesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.44,0:11:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伙计 - 你搞什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dude, seriously. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.15,0:11:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和凯伦再谈一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna talk to Karen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,问问她是不是认识Dana Shulps这个人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}see if she knows anything about this Dana Shulps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.86,0:11:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.62,0:11:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着用功吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going, sparky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.29,0:11:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着迪恩就回到了凯伦的住处看一看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean went back to Karen's place to check up on her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.29,0:11:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思 你知道的 我先前很不安的样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you know, she'd been pretty upset earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么不和他一起去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why didn't you go with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.29,0:11:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我直接回了汽车旅馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just went back to the motel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.51,0:12:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便问一下 你怎么知道我在那儿的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know I was there, by the way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在逮捕你哥哥时 发现了那些汽车旅馆小册子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found the motel matchbook on your brother when we arrested him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再兜圈子了 在巴尔的摩你一直和你哥哥在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's quit fooling around.You were with your brother the whole time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.31,0:12:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在为什么没在一起？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were in Baltimore.Why separate now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.90,0:12:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为你哥哥撇下你之后 去杀凯伦了 - 他没杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your brother left to go murder Karen. - He didn't kill anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.82,0:12:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到911的电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard the 911 call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.15,0:12:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦很害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen was terrified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说有人在她家里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said someone was in the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.43,0:13:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 紧急事件服务中心 - 有人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Emergency services. - Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.94,0:13:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看到有陌生人在我家里 - 你的住址 女士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think I saw somebody in my house. - What is your address?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.11,0:13:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林顿大街421号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 421 Clinton Avenue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.49,0:13:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请你们 - 哈喽？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, can you? Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦 你在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen, you in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.90,0:15:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的 这到底是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, what the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.21,0:16:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze.Stay on your knees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手举起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands where I can see them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.13,0:16:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.05,0:16:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,拷住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuff him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.03,0:16:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你一直盯着他？- 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You getting anywhere with him? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.11,0:16:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是听他说些鬼话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a lot of wise ass remarks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.45,0:16:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆说的和昨天迪恩交待的相附{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's story matches Dean's to the last detail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.79,0:16:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这两个家伙真有默契 我要让他们好看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Well, these guys are good, I'll give them that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.63,0:16:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果萨姆不肯说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't get Sam to flip, we have nothing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.04,0:16:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们除了环境证据外就没有其它证据了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a lot of circumstantial evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.88,0:16:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在犯罪现场逮到迪恩的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got Dean at the crime scene…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时他手上还有血呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with blood on his hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.43,0:16:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,陪审团至少会采纳一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Juries have convicted for less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.93,0:17:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但杀人凶器在拿呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but, I mean, where's the murder weapon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.18,0:17:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,动机是什么？你说过要有合理的怀疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the motive? You talk about reasonable doubt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.85,0:17:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴安娜…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.94,0:17:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能提出合理怀疑吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you have reasonable doubt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.36,0:17:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要时刻关注这两人个 其中一个必是突破口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We keep leaning on these guys, one of them will tumble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.57,0:17:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要忘记圣路易丝的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't forget about St.Louis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.45,0:17:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说 迪恩就是我们要找的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, this Dean guy is our guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 托尼·吉尔斯是你的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Tony Giles was a friend of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他是的 而且是好朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he was.He was a good friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.17,0:17:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想快点了结这个案子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, and I know you wanna clean this mess up quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 托尼知道很多犯罪类型 也许我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But come on, Tony knew a lot of criminal types, maybe we just{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.17,0:17:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,犯罪类型？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Criminal types?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.09,0:17:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他是一个辩护律师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a defense lawyer for God's sakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.30,0:17:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当然知道犯罪类型{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he knew criminal types.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.97,0:17:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 我们再去问问他俩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.All right, let's get back at them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.23,0:17:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们好好想想吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.You know what?\NLet them stew in their juices for a bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.82,0:17:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这边来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.33,0:18:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs18\1c&H3CF1F3&}\NDana Shulps Dana Shulps
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.42,0:18:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs18\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dana…Dana Shulps
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.93,0:18:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有可能不是人名 这有可能不是人名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's not a name.Maybe it's not a name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.85,0:18:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,错位构词吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anagram maybe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.87,0:18:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 温彻斯特先生吗？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr.Winchester? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.08,0:18:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是杰夫·克劳斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Jeff Krause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.46,0:18:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是公共辩护团的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with the public defender's office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的律师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your lawyer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.55,0:18:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 感谢上帝 我有救了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God, I'm saved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,能借我笔和纸吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can I steal a pen from you, some paper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.18,0:19:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.76,0:19:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察还没发现凶器 那样很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the police haven't found a weapon yet, so that's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.90,0:19:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他们发现了你的指纹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they got your prints…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手上的鲜血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, literally, blood on your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.90,0:19:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上你在警局的记录{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with your police record…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.12,0:19:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,温彻斯特先生？你在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr.Winchester, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.91,0:19:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得这里用的是错位构词 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think it's an anagram. - A what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.71,0:19:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,错位构词 同样的字母 排列成不同的单词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An anagram.Same letters, different words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.75,0:19:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能帮我个忙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you do me a favor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.79,0:19:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看能不能认出这几个词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if you recognize any of these words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.09,0:19:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,本地的人名 地名 诸如此类的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Local names, places, anything like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.51,0:19:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知不知道这些指控有多严重？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand how serious these charges are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正铐在张桌子上 是的 我有数{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm handcuffed to a table.Yeah, I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.14,0:19:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当满足我一下 看一眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humor me.Take a quick look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:20:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,S- U- P？不是很清楚 不过…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-U-P, I don't know about that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.49,0:20:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿什兰是一条街的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Ashland is a street name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.49,0:20:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离这里不远 - 街名？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not far from here. - Street?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.87,0:20:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么先告诉我 托尼·吉尔斯死的那天晚上你在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's start with where you were the night that Anthony Giles died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.79,0:20:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能见到我弟弟吗？- 温彻斯特先生…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you get in to see my brother? - Mr.Winchester…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.75,0:20:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有可能被判死刑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could be facing a death penalty here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.46,0:20:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的法律咨询 马特洛克先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, thanks for the law review, Matlock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.13,0:20:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可如果你真想帮我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you wanna help me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.30,0:20:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就请你去见我弟弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to see my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.68,0:21:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望那对你有用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope that was meaningful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.19,0:21:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我现在想讨论一下你的案子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'd like to discuss your case now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.02,0:21:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 马特洛克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure thing, Matlock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.61,0:21:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩真不愧是亲兄弟？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two really are brothers, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.53,0:21:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在… 如你所知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, as you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.07,0:21:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,地方法官可能会打算要…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the DA might be interested in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.74,0:21:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你去陪同另一位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you.With the other one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.47,0:21:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,律师先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Counselor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.72,0:21:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的当事人决定要招供了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}your boy decided to confess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.72,0:21:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,温彻斯特先生 我强烈建议你不要这样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr.Winchester, I'd advise against that strongly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.60,0:21:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对着摄像头说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk directly into the camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.39,0:22:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,先说说你叫什么名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start by stating your name for the record.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.23,0:22:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫迪恩·温彻斯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Dean Winchester.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.74,0:22:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是水瓶座 我喜欢看日落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an Aquarius.I enjoy sunsets…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.24,0:22:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢打着赤脚走在沙滩上 还喜欢火辣的女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}long walks on the beach, and frisky women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.91,0:22:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有杀人 可我知道是谁干的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I did not kill anyone.But I know who did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.58,0:22:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者说什么东西干的更确切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or rather, what did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我还不能十分肯定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, it can't be for sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.05,0:22:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我在调查的时候被抓住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because our investigation was interrupted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.00,0:22:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们的想法是 我们要找的是一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our working theory is that we're looking for a kind of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.92,0:22:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇的幽灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}vengeful spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.76,0:22:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.59,0:22:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 鬼马小精灵的嗜血杀手版{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Casper the bloodthirsty ghost?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.30,0:22:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼·吉尔斯看见过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony Giles saw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.93,0:22:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌那个凯伦女孩也见过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bet you cash money Karen did too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.10,0:22:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 有趣的是它留下的字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The interesting thing is the word it leaves behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.77,0:22:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,出于某些原因 它试图告诉我们些什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For some reason, it's trying to tell us something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.15,0:22:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是和这个世界沟通并不容易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But communicating across the veil aingt easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.28,0:22:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候这些幽灵会把事情弄糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes the spirits, they get things jumbled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.28,0:22:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听过Redrum（反过来是谋杀Murder）吧 那是一样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember redrum? Same concept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.28,0:22:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可能是断字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's…Could be word fragments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.62,0:22:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他时候…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other times…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.17,0:23:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是被打乱的单词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's anagrams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.17,0:23:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,起初我们猜想 那是一个名字Dana Suhulps{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, at first we thought this was a name, Dana Shulps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.71,0:23:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在我们觉得那是条街道 阿什兰大街{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now, we think it's a street.Ashland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.63,0:23:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever's going on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.97,0:23:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我猜想那里就是源头 - 你这个傲慢的混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …I'm betting it started there. - You arrogant bastard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.31,0:23:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼和凯伦都是正派人 你却在拿他们开玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony and Karen were good people.You're making jokes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.02,0:23:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没开玩笑 蠢货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not joking, Ponch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.81,0:23:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你冷血地谋杀了他们 就象你杀那个圣路易斯的女孩一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You murdered them in cold blood just like that girl in St.Louis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.82,0:23:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 对了 那也不是我干的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, that wasn't me either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.49,0:23:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个变成我模样的变形人干的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a shapeshifter creature that only looked like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.66,0:23:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 嘿 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up.Hey, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮特 放手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete, that is enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.83,0:23:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你要我说实话的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked for the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.08,0:23:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock his ass up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.26,0:23:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.18,0:24:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他人呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.86,0:24:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是怎样做到的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd he do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.36,0:24:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,消防梯离的那么远。-。-{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fire escape's way over{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.24,0:24:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 这两家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - These two guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.29,0:24:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,希尔茨和麦奎因？什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilts and McQueen? What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.87,0:24:27.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,希尔茨是斯蒂夫·麦奎因 在《大逃亡》中演的角色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilts is Steve McQueen's character in The Great Escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.06,0:25:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能快点结束 我有点累了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we make this quick? I'm a little tired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.69,0:25:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一天太漫长了 加上你那搭档不断折腾我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long day, with your partner assaulting me and all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.11,0:25:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想多了解一些 你早些时候谈到过的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know more about that stuff you were talking about earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.61,0:25:40.28,Title,0,0,0,0,,时代生活出版 《神秘未知》 自己看书去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time Life, Mysteries of the Unknown.Look it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.50,0:25:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们假设 你不是个彻头彻尾的疯子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's pretend for the moment you're not entirely insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.46,0:25:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的那种东西究竟想做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would one of these things be doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.84,0:25:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇的幽灵？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A vengeful spirit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.39,0:26:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们通常都死得很惨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're created by violent deaths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.22,0:26:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们回来都是有原因的 往往都不是什么好事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then they come back for a reason, usually a nasty one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.48,0:26:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说向伤害过他们的人们复仇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like revenge on the people that hurt them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.40,0:26:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些幽灵…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these spirits…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.98,0:26:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有能力杀人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're capable of killing people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.53,0:26:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的手怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.83,0:26:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.50,0:26:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,原先没有的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't there before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.67,0:26:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过它了 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen it, haven't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.05,0:26:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那幽灵 - 你怎么知道的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The spirit. - How did you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.26,0:26:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦手上也有同样的淤痕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Karen had the same bruises on her wrists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.68,0:26:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌如果你去查看吉尔斯尸检的照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet that if you look at Giles'autopsy photos{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.30,0:26:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,会看到他的手上也有同样的淤痕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's got them too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.02,0:26:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事肯定跟那幽灵有关 虽然我不知道具体是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got something to do with this spirit.I don't know what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.86,0:26:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.69,0:26:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定以为自己是疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're going crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.65,0:26:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在不是抒发体验的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's skip that part, shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.15,0:27:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为最近两个看到这东西的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the last two people who saw this thing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.78,0:27:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,都很快死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}died pretty soon after.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.54,0:27:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到我说什么了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.79,0:27:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我会死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm gonna die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.54,0:27:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须去找萨姆 他会帮你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to go to Sam.He'll help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.09,0:27:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要出卖你弟弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're giving your brother up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.17,0:27:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,去黄页上的第一家汽车旅馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the first motel in the yellow pages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.60,0:27:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,找一个叫吉姆·罗克福德的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look for Jim Rockford.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.72,0:27:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我们在走散时 找到彼此的办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's how we find each other when we separate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.06,0:27:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以逮捕他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can arrest him if you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.10,0:27:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可以让他救你的命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you can let him save your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.49,0:27:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是在她出现才有的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These showed up after you saw it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.50,0:27:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.58,0:27:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.08,0:27:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得告诉我你看到的每一个细节{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to tell me exactly what you saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.25,0:27:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定是疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I must be losing my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.84,0:28:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个通缉犯 我应该逮捕你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a fugitive.I should be arresting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.84,0:28:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, you know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.09,0:28:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以在活下来后再逮捕我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can arrest me later.After you live through this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.01,0:28:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在 你得告诉我 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But right now, you gotta talk to me.Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.77,0:28:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 很好 那么那个幽灵 它长什么样的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, great.Now, the spirit, what did it look like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.02,0:28:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她 呃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.11,0:28:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,苍白如纸…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}really pale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.24,0:28:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且她的喉咙被割断了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her throat was cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.11,0:28:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的眼睛 深红深红的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her eyes, they were like this deep dark red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.86,0:28:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看起来像要告诉我什么 但她说不出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appeared like she was trying to talk to me, but she couldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.87,0:28:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,只出来… 很多血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a lot of blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.29,0:28:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗？过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.92,0:28:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经查出在阿什兰街 所有已死或失踪的女孩了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been researching every girl who's died.or gone missing from Ashland Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.34,0:28:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么得到这些的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get those?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.76,0:28:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是犯罪现场的照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are from crime scenes and booking photos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.47,0:28:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有你的工作 我也有我的本事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have your job, I have mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.47,0:28:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 我需要你浏览一下这些 有认识的就说一声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, I need you to look through these, tell me if you recognize anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.70,0:29:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是她了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.07,0:29:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.66,0:29:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔·贝克尔？28岁 在八九个月前失踪的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Claire Becker, 28 years old.Disappeared about eight or nine months ago."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.58,0:29:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我根本不认识她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't even know her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.17,0:29:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为什么要跟着我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would she come after me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.00,0:29:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她死前 因为贩毒被抓过两次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, before her death, she was arrested twice for dealing heroin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.38,0:29:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在缉毒组工作过吗？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ever work Narcotics? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.18,0:29:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在进凶杀组前 皮特r和我是那里的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete and I did.Before Homicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.51,0:29:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你逮捕过她吗？- 我记得没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ever bust her? - Not that I remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.44,0:29:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面说最后一次有人看见 她进了阿什兰街2911号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says she was last seen entering 2911 Ashland Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.40,0:29:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察搜查过附近 但一无所获{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police searched the place, didn't find anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.53,0:29:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该去那看看 看能不能找到她的尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we gotta check it out ourselves.See if we can find her body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.82,0:29:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.83,0:29:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒上盐然后把她的尸体烧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we gotta salt and burn her bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.66,0:29:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是唯一能让她安息的方法了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way to put her spirit to rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.54,0:29:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.56,0:30:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们到底在找什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what exactly are we looking for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.14,0:30:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了就知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll let you know when we find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.62,0:31:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.20,0:31:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.96,0:31:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.63,0:31:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我在这里 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.Hey, I'm here.What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.63,0:31:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出什么事了？- 克莱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - Claire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.34,0:31:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪里？- 她刚才就在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - She was here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.13,0:31:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有攻击你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she attack you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.51,0:31:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 没有 她只是把手伸向我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.No, she was just, like, reaching out to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.80,0:31:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在窗户的那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was over there by the window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.07,0:31:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 帮我挪开它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait.Help me move this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.83,0:32:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们的小小字谜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our little mystery word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.18,0:32:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加上其他的字母就讲得通了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the extra letters make sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.52,0:32:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.19,0:32:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魂和某些尸骸会发出电磁波{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, spirits and certain remains give off electro magnetic frequencies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.19,0:32:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 如果克莱尔的尸体在这里 那东西就会显示出来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if Claire's body was here, that would indicate that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.11,0:32:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 理论上是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.Well, that's the theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.56,0:33:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 没错 肯定有什么东西在这里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah.There's definitely something in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.90,0:33:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 这事有点儿让我头疼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this is bothering me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.61,0:33:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 你是在挖一具尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you are digging up a corpse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.61,0:33:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是指那个 这种事 嗯 其实我们经常做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not that.That's pretty par for the course, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.16,0:33:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.58,0:33:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是… 我是说 我对付过的那些想复仇的恶灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…I mean, no vengeful spirit I've ever tussled with…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.92,0:33:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有哪个恶灵是希望自己被干掉的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}wanted to be wasted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.84,0:33:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟为什么克莱尔要带我们找到她的遗骸？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why would Claire lead us to her remains?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.67,0:33:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根本讲不通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't make any sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.68,0:33:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 就是这儿 帮我一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here.Give me a hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.63,0:34:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的手腕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her wrists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.47,0:34:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 跟你一样的淤伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they'd be bruised just like yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.31,0:34:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过这个项链？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That necklace mean something to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.61,0:34:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前见过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen it before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.69,0:34:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种项链很少见 是在卡森大街的商店里定做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's rare.It was custom made over on Carson Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.99,0:34:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一条跟这一模一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have one just like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.33,0:34:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是皮特给我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete gave it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.30,0:34:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在一切都讲得通了 - 你说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now this all makes perfect sense. - I'm sorry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.38,0:34:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧 克莱尔不是一个要报仇的恶灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you see, Claire is not a vengeful spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.80,0:35:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是一个死亡预兆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a death omen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.68,0:35:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.01,0:35:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔没有杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire's not killing anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.72,0:35:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是想警告他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's trying to warn them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.35,0:35:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧 有些幽灵并不想报仇 他们只想找回公道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, sometimes spirits don't want vengeance, they want justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.52,0:35:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是她为什么要带我们来这儿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why she led us here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.40,0:35:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想要我们知道杀她的凶手是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants us to know who her killer is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.57,0:35:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官 你对你搭档的了解多少？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do you know about your partner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.45,0:35:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 我的天 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.08,0:35:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概在一年前 警察局里有一些海洛因被盗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a year ago, some heroin went missing from lockup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.09,0:35:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然是个警察干的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously it was a cop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.38,0:35:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直没查出是谁干的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never found out who did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.47,0:35:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是谁 都需要找人销赃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But whoever did it would need someone to fence their product.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.89,0:35:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说毒品贩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody like a heroin dealer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.14,0:35:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如象克莱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody like Claire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.94,0:35:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我要被引渡回圣路易斯了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm being extradited to St.Louis, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.36,0:36:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你擅自决定要在凌晨两点 亲自开车800英里送我过去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you just decided to transfer me yourself, 800 miles at 2 in the morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.50,0:36:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是什么好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.58,0:36:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.88,0:36:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 皮特刚刚离开管区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - Pete just left the precinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.46,0:36:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 带着迪恩 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- With Dean. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.09,0:36:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说要把罪犯移送到另一个地方 接着就把他带走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said the prisoner had to be transferred, and he just took him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.59,0:36:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,调度官用无线电呼叫过他 没有回音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dispatch has been calling.He won't answer the radio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.51,0:36:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 无线电？他开走了局里的车？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Radio? He took a county vehicle? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.60,0:36:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么车上应该装有防盗定位器 你得把它打开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should have a LoJack.You just gotta get it turned on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.61,0:36:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么快就要尿尿了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pee break? So soon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.41,0:36:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你该去检查一下你的前列腺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you might wanna get your prostate checked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.71,0:37:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗娘养的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.47,0:37:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我在车里挺舒服的 你去干你的吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm cool in the van.You go do what you gotta do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.18,0:37:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这狂妄的贱人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a cocky son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.94,0:37:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为圣路易斯那些家伙会吃你那套？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think those people in St.Louis are gonna buy that crap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.19,0:37:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦白告诉你吧 你活不到圣路易斯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the thing.You're not gonna make it to St.Louis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.07,0:37:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就要因为企图逃跑而被击毙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna die trying to escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.08,0:37:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.70,0:37:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们谈谈这事 你不是真打算做出让你后悔的事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk about this.You don't wanna do something you're gonna regret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.67,0:37:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许你会 - 皮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or maybe you do. - Pete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.50,0:37:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把枪放下 - 戴安娜？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put the gun down. - Diana?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.67,0:37:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么找到我的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you find me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.17,0:37:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经知道克莱尔的事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know about Claire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.67,0:37:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道你在说什么 - 放下枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know what you're talking about. - Put the gun down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.76,0:37:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不会放下的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.01,0:37:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是很快 可我肯定比你更快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fast.Pretty sure I'm faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.27,0:37:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么要这么做？- 我什么都没干戴安娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are you doing this? - I didn't do anything, Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.69,0:37:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在说这些有点太晚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little late for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.36,0:38:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不能怪我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.53,0:38:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔要告发我 我没有别的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire was gonna turn me in.I had no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.19,0:38:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那托尼和凯伦呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Tony? Karen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.74,0:38:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.28,0:38:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尼洗了钱 可接着他就慌了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony scrubbed the money.Then he got skittish…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.91,0:38:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就想要金盆洗手 我敢肯定他把一切都告诉凯伦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then he wanted to come clean.I'm sure he told Karen everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.25,0:38:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都乱了套 我得清理干净{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a mess, I had to clean it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.29,0:38:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是昏了头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just panicked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.54,0:38:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底还有多少人要为此而死 皮特？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many more people are gonna die over this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.05,0:38:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个解决方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.05,0:38:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个叫迪恩的小子简直是天赐良机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Dean kid's a frigging gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.56,0:38:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以把所有罪名都推到他身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can pin the whole thing on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.05,0:38:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？没有审讯 什么都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? No trial, nothing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.27,0:38:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过又多了个死掉的人渣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just one more dead scumbag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.39,0:38:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.56,0:38:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人会起疑心的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will question it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.81,0:38:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 戴安娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diana, please…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.15,0:38:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是爱你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.16,0:38:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.34,0:39:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么没给我另买一条项链 烂人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, why don't you buy me another necklace, you ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.59,0:39:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来 别过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do it.Don't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.44,0:40:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You doing all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.73,0:40:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.94,0:40:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个预示死亡的克莱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The death omen, Claire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.49,0:40:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她现在怎么样了？- 一切都结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happens to her now? - It should be over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.99,0:40:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她应该可以安息了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She should be at rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.12,0:40:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 现在怎么办 警官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what now, officer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.25,0:40:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮特对我坦白了罪行 他在你们俩的案子里做了手脚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete did confess to me, he screwed up both your cases royally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.54,0:40:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 这是一个把你们的案子撤掉的好机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say there's a good chance that we can get your cases dismissed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.96,0:40:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能帮我们搞定这事？- 希望如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You could take care of that for us? - I hope so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.63,0:40:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是圣路易斯谋杀案的指控{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the St.Louis murder charges?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.01,0:40:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,又另一码事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's another story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.05,0:40:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我帮不了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.43,0:40:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.97,0:40:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我碰巧转过身 你们就跑掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just happened to turn my back, and you walked away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.89,0:40:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以告诉他们嫌犯逃走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could tell them the suspects escaped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.10,0:40:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 你说真的？- 是啊 她当然是认真的 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, are you sure? - Yeah, she's sure, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.36,0:40:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是说 你可能会因为这事丢掉工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's just you could lose your job over something like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.94,0:40:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想让你们俩去做该做的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you guys out there doing what you do best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.45,0:40:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 这样我晚上会睡得更好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.I'll sleep better at night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.53,0:40:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你们要小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you need to watch your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.41,0:41:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你们两个都被盯上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna be looking for both of you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.95,0:41:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 我得去报告了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here.I gotta radio this in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.79,0:41:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会凑巧知道我的车在哪儿吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wouldn't happen to know where my car is by chance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.79,0:41:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,扣押在罗伯逊的停车场里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's at the impound yard on Robertson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.05,0:41:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,想都别想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.01,0:41:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, it's all right.Don't worry.We'll…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.51,0:41:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会装成相关人员 这我们拿手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just improvise.We're good at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.68,0:41:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我注意到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I've noticed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.27,0:41:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真是个好人 - 是啊 对警察来说是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice lady. - Yeah, for a cop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.15,0:41:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得她眼熟吗？- 不 为什么这么问？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does she look familiar to you? - No, why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.69,0:41:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 嘿 你饿吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.Anyway, are you hungry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.61,0:41:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不饿 - 不知道为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - For some reason…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.15,0:41:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想来点豆子汤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could really go for some pea soup.{\r}
